From bb23d7927f3c6ef4883cd4460bbefee00086f7bd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 20 Aug 2026 11:47:07 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] net: airoha: Add support for Nokia/ALCL GPON OLTs

Add support for Nokia/ALCL OLTs by implementing automatic MIB seeding for
VEIP-based datapath configuration, correcting encryption key handling, and
fixing AES shadow key loading.

- Airoha: Manage service cookies to track rules, fix GEM port CRC failures
  due to byte-swapped AES keys, and disable HW GRO instead of failing to
  open the interface.
- OMCI: Pre-seed Nokia-specific MIB profiles (T-CONTs, GEM TPs, mappers,
  and bridges) to support HGU/VEIP mode.
- PLOAM: Fix encryption key exchange timing and fragmentation to meet
  Nokia OLT requirements.

Signed-off-by: Cristian Papa <pcristian292@gmail.com>
Signed-off-by: Ifran Ali <khanu.i.i.k.2000@gmail.com>
Signed-off-by: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <me@sirherobrine23.com.br>
Reviewed-by: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <me@sirherobrine23.com.br>
Signed-off-by: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
---
